{"seq":2,"slug":"derivatives-taxonomy","title":"衍生品分类体系与市场结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/options-derivatives-pricing/foundations/derivatives-taxonomy","wordCount":2407,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"衍生品分类体系与市场结构\">衍生品分类体系与市场结构</h1><p>衍生品（Derivatives）是价值依赖于一个或多个标的资产的金融合约。从最简单的远期合约到复杂的结构化产品，衍生品市场已发展为全球金融体系中规模最大的市场之一。根据国际清算银行（BIS）2025 年统计，全球场外衍生品名义本金超过 700 万亿美元，场内衍生品日均交易量超过万亿美元量级。理解衍生品的分类体系与市场结构，是掌握定价理论的必要前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本文围绕衍生品市场的全景展开，核心概念包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>四大基本合约</strong>：远期、期货、互换、期权——所有复杂产品都是它们的组合或变体</li>\n<li><strong>线性 vs 非线性收益</strong>：远期/期货/互换为线性收益（定价简单），期权为非线性收益（定价复杂）</li>\n<li><strong>场内 vs 场外</strong>：标准化+中央清算 vs 定制化+对手方风险——影响定价中的信用调整</li>\n<li><strong>统一定价原理</strong>：无论产品形式如何，定价方法殊途同归——在风险中性测度下计算未来收益的贴现期望</li>\n<li><strong>市场微观结构</strong>：保证金制度、逐日盯市、净额结算等机制影响实际定价和对冲成本</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"衍生品的四大基本类别\">衍生品的四大基本类别</h2><p>金融衍生品按合约结构可分为四大基本类别，所有复杂产品都是这四类的组合或变体：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[金融衍生品] --&gt; B[远期合约 Forward]&#10;    A --&gt; C[期货合约 Futures]&#10;    A --&gt; D[互换合约 Swap]&#10;    A --&gt; E[期权合约 Option]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[场外交易 OTC]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[定制化条款]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[信用风险暴露]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[场内交易 Exchange]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[标准化合约]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[逐日盯市 Daily Settlement]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[现金流交换]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[利率互换 IRS]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[货币互换 CCS]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[非对称权利]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[非线性收益]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[时间价值衰减]\">flowchart TD\n    A[金融衍生品] --&gt; B[远期合约 Forward]\n    A --&gt; C[期货合约 Futures]\n    A --&gt; D[互换合约 Swap]\n    A --&gt; E[期权合约 Option]\n    B --&gt; B1[场外交易 OTC]\n    B --&gt; B2[定制化条款]\n    B --&gt; B3[信用风险暴露]\n    C --&gt; C1[场内交易 Exchange]\n    C --&gt; C2[标准化合约]\n    C --&gt; C3[逐日盯市 Daily Settlement]\n    D --&gt; D1[现金流交换]\n    D --&gt; D2[利率互换 IRS]\n    D --&gt; D3[货币互换 CCS]\n    E --&gt; E1[非对称权利]\n    E --&gt; E2[非线性收益]\n    E --&gt; E3[时间价值衰减]</pre><h3 id=\"远期合约-forward-contract\">远期合约（Forward Contract）</h3><p>远期合约是最基本的衍生品形式——双方约定在未来某一时点以约定价格买卖一定数量的标的资产。</p>\n<p><strong>远期价格的确定</strong>：对于无红利标的资产，远期价格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由无套利条件确定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_0 = S_0 \\cdot e^{rT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为当前即期价格，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为无风险利率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 为合约期限。这一公式的推导基于现金-持有（cash-and-carry）套利论证。</p>\n<p>对于支付连续红利率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 的标的：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_0 = S_0 \\cdot e^{(r-q)T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"期货合约-futures-contract\">期货合约（Futures Contract）</h3><p>期货是标准化、场内交易的远期合约。与远期的核心区别在于<strong>逐日盯市</strong>（marking to market）机制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>远期</th>\n<th>期货</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交易场所</td>\n<td>OTC（双边协商）</td>\n<td>交易所（集中交易）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合约条款</td>\n<td>定制化</td>\n<td>标准化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算方式</td>\n<td>到期结算</td>\n<td>逐日盯市</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信用风险</td>\n<td>对手方风险</td>\n<td>清算所担保</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保证金</td>\n<td>无（或双边约定）</td>\n<td>初始保证金 + 维持保证金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流动性</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提前了结</td>\n<td>协商</td>\n<td>对冲平仓</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>逐日盯市机制使得期货价格与远期价格在利率确定（非随机）时相等，但在利率随机时可能产生差异（凸性调整 convexity adjustment）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"互换合约-swap\">互换合约（Swap）</h3><p>互换是双方约定在未来一系列日期交换现金流的协议。最常见的形式是利率互换（Interest Rate Swap, IRS），一方支付固定利率，另一方支付浮动利率：</p>\n<p><strong>利率互换的定价</strong>：可将互换视为一系列远期利率协议（FRA）的组合，或视为固定利率债券与浮动利率债券的交换：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>swap</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>fixed</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>floating</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{swap}} = B_{\\text{fixed}} - B_{\\text{floating}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">swap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fixed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">floating</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>互换市场是全球最大的衍生品市场，名义本金超过 400 万亿美元，互换利率曲线已成为许多市场的基准贴现曲线。</p>\n<h3 id=\"期权合约-option\">期权合约（Option）</h3><p>期权与前三类衍生品的根本区别在于<strong>权利的非对称性</strong>——买方有权但无义务执行合约。这使得期权具有非线性收益结构，也使其定价远比远期/期货复杂。期权是本 hub 的核心研究对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"按标的资产分类\">按标的资产分类</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标的资产类别</th>\n<th>典型产品</th>\n<th>市场特征</th>\n<th>定价难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>股票期权</td>\n<td>个股期权、指数期权</td>\n<td>离散红利、提前行权</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外汇期权</td>\n<td>货币对期权</td>\n<td>双利率结构（Garman-Kohlhagen）</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品期权</td>\n<td>原油、黄金、农产品</td>\n<td>便利收益率、季节性、存储成本</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利率期权</td>\n<td>利率上限（Cap）、互换期权（Swaption）</td>\n<td>利率期限结构、均值回归</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信用衍生品</td>\n<td>CDS、CDO</td>\n<td>违约概率、回收率</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>波动率衍生品</td>\n<td>VIX 期权、方差互换</td>\n<td>波动率的波动率</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"场内市场与场外市场\">场内市场与场外市场</h2><h3 id=\"场内市场-exchange-traded-market\">场内市场（Exchange-Traded Market）</h3><p>场内衍生品通过集中交易所撮合成交，具有以下特征：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>标准化</strong>：合约条款（到期日、行权价间距、合约乘数）由交易所统一规定</li>\n<li><strong>中央对手方清算（CCP）</strong>：清算所作为所有交易的对手方，消除信用风险</li>\n<li><strong>保证金制度</strong>：初始保证金（initial margin）+ 维持保证金（maintenance margin）+ 逐日盯市</li>\n<li><strong>价格透明</strong>：买卖报价实时可见</li>\n</ol>\n<p>全球主要的期权交易所包括：CBOE（芝加哥期权交易所）、CME Group、Eurex、上海证券交易所（50ETF 期权）、中金所（股指期权）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"场外市场-over-the-counter-otc\">场外市场（Over-The-Counter, OTC）</h3><p>场外市场占全球衍生品名义本金的绝大部分（约 80%），主要服务于机构投资者的定制化需求：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>灵活性</strong>：条款完全可定制（非标准行权价、嵌入式结构）</li>\n<li><strong>信用风险管理</strong>：CSA（信用支持附件）规定保证金交换规则</li>\n<li><strong>ISDA 主协议</strong>：标准化法律框架，包含净额结算（netting）条款</li>\n<li><strong>后 2008 改革</strong>：Dodd-Frank / EMIR 要求标准化 OTC 衍生品通过 CCP 清算</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"2008-年金融危机后的市场改革\">2008 年金融危机后的市场改革</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>改革措施</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强制中央清算</td>\n<td>降低系统性信用风险</td>\n<td>OTC 衍生品清算率从 &lt;20% 提升至 &gt;70%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交易报告（Trade Reporting）</td>\n<td>提高透明度</td>\n<td>监管层可监控全市场风险暴露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非清算衍生品保证金规则（UMR）</td>\n<td>覆盖剩余信用风险</td>\n<td>增加资本占用成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基准利率改革（IBOR 转换）</td>\n<td>消除操纵风险</td>\n<td>LIBOR → SOFR/SONIA 等无风险利率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"衍生品定价的统一框架\">衍生品定价的统一框架</h2><p>尽管衍生品形式多样，其定价遵循统一的理论框架：</p>\n<h3 id=\"无套利定价原则\">无套利定价原则</h3><p>所有衍生品定价的核心假设是<strong>市场中不存在无风险套利机会</strong>。在此假设下：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>具有相同未来现金流的资产组合必须具有相同的当前价格（一价定律）</li>\n<li>衍生品价格可以通过构造复制组合（replicating portfolio）来确定</li>\n<li>复制组合的成本即为衍生品的公允价格</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"风险中性定价框架\">风险中性定价框架</h3><p>在无套利条件下，存在等价鞅测度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{Q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8556em;vertical-align:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>（风险中性测度），使得衍生品价格等于其未来收益在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{Q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8556em;vertical-align:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 下期望的贴现值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_0 = e^{-rT} \\cdot \\mathbb{E}^{\\mathbb{Q}}[V_T]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1452em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8952em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathbb mtight\">Q</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一框架统一了所有衍生品的定价方法，无论是远期、期货、互换还是期权。</p>\n<h3 id=\"从简单到复杂的定价方法演进\">从简单到复杂的定价方法演进</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>产品类型</th>\n<th>定价方法</th>\n<th>复杂度来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>远期/期货</td>\n<td>无套利 + 现金持有</td>\n<td>低——线性收益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>普通期权</td>\n<td>Black-Scholes / 二叉树</td>\n<td>中——非线性收益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美式期权</td>\n<td>二叉树 / 有限差分 / LSM</td>\n<td>高——最优停时问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路径依赖期权</td>\n<td>蒙特卡洛 / PDE</td>\n<td>高——全路径信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利率衍生品</td>\n<td>HJM / LMM + 数值方法</td>\n<td>很高——期限结构动态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"市场参与者与动机\">市场参与者与动机</h2><p>衍生品市场的参与者可以按其交易动机分为三类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参与者类型</th>\n<th>动机</th>\n<th>典型行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>对冲者（Hedger）</td>\n<td>转移风险</td>\n<td>持有标的资产的同时买入看跌期权保护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投机者（Speculator）</td>\n<td>赚取方向性收益</td>\n<td>看多波动率时买入跨式组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>套利者（Arbitrageur）</td>\n<td>赚取无风险利润</td>\n<td>利用 Put-Call Parity 偏离进行套利</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三类参与者共同提供流动性、促进价格发现，使衍生品价格趋向理论公允价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"衍生品市场的系统性风险\">衍生品市场的系统性风险</h2><p>2008 年金融危机揭示了衍生品市场中的系统性风险传导机制：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>对手方风险连锁</strong>：AIG 作为 CDS 卖方的过度集中暴露</li>\n<li><strong>杠杆效应</strong>：衍生品的保证金交易使得名义暴露远超实际资本</li>\n<li><strong>流动性螺旋</strong>：市场压力下保证金追缴导致被迫平仓，进一步压低价格</li>\n<li><strong>模型风险</strong>：高斯 Copula 等模型的假设在极端情况下失效</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这些经验教训推动了后危机时代的市场改革，也深刻影响了衍生品定价中对信用风险（CVA）、资本成本（KVA）和流动性风险（LVA）的考量——统称为 xVA 调整。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>衍生品市场是全球金融体系的核心基础设施，其规模和复杂度远超大部分人的直觉。四大基本合约（远期、期货、互换、期权）构成了整个衍生品世界的基础积木，所有复杂产品都是它们的组合。场内市场通过标准化和中央清算提供安全性和流动性，场外市场通过定制化满足多样需求但引入信用风险。2008 年金融危机后的改革重塑了市场结构，推动了 xVA 定价框架的发展——这意味着现代衍生品定价不仅要考虑产品本身的理论价值，还要纳入信用、融资和资本成本等现实因素。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>相关文档</strong>：<a href=\"options-fundamentals\">期权合约基础与收益结构</a> | <a href=\"no-arbitrage-pricing\">无套利定价与风险中性框架</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"衍生品分类体系与市场结构","id":"衍生品分类体系与市场结构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"衍生品的四大基本类别","id":"衍生品的四大基本类别"},{"level":3,"text":"远期合约（Forward Contract）","id":"远期合约-forward-contract"},{"level":3,"text":"期货合约（Futures Contract）","id":"期货合约-futures-contract"},{"level":3,"text":"互换合约（Swap）","id":"互换合约-swap"},{"level":3,"text":"期权合约（Option）","id":"期权合约-option"},{"level":2,"text":"按标的资产分类","id":"按标的资产分类"},{"level":2,"text":"场内市场与场外市场","id":"场内市场与场外市场"},{"level":3,"text":"场内市场（Exchange-Traded Market）","id":"场内市场-exchange-traded-market"},{"level":3,"text":"场外市场（Over-The-Counter, OTC）","id":"场外市场-over-the-counter-otc"},{"level":3,"text":"2008 年金融危机后的市场改革","id":"2008-年金融危机后的市场改革"},{"level":2,"text":"衍生品定价的统一框架","id":"衍生品定价的统一框架"},{"level":3,"text":"无套利定价原则","id":"无套利定价原则"},{"level":3,"text":"风险中性定价框架","id":"风险中性定价框架"},{"level":3,"text":"从简单到复杂的定价方法演进","id":"从简单到复杂的定价方法演进"},{"level":2,"text":"市场参与者与动机","id":"市场参与者与动机"},{"level":2,"text":"衍生品市场的系统性风险","id":"衍生品市场的系统性风险"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"期权合约基础与收益结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/options-derivatives-pricing/foundations/options-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"无套利定价与风险中性框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/options-derivatives-pricing/foundations/no-arbitrage-pricing"}}